From 2b01345f50866b8be4f78eede22d7365b84226c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:09:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] docs: update the README feature status for the deployed
 inference loop

With an inventory and a runtime launcher the control plane now
schedules, deploys, publishes status.endpoints and deletes services.
Say so in the feature overview, note that deployments use the control
plane's own vLLM launcher rather than the runtime-vllm plugin and that
there is no TGI launcher yet, and refresh the test count.
---
 README.md | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 0e6cc8f..6a1ef3c 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -288,7 +288,7 @@ ForgeMesh 目前处于预览阶段，API 稳定性标注为 `beta`：minor 版
 
